15. Fix 7 – Review Annotation Handling

Because the exception specifically references an annotation dictionary, the PDF handling needs to account for malformed or unsupported annotations.

The implementation should determine whether the problematic annotation can be:

* safely normalized,
* removed,
* ignored during merge,
* or otherwise handled by the supported Aspose API.

The preferred approach should be:

Valid annotation
      ↓
Retain
Unsupported/malformed annotation
      ↓
Handle safely
      ↓
Continue PDF processing

Any removal of annotations should only be performed if annotations are not required for the business/document-delivery requirement.

This should be confirmed during implementation rather than automatically removing all annotations.

